@PortfolioService_HostAddress = https://localhost:7252
@Gateway_HostAddress = https://localhost:7000

### Register user (direct to Portfolio Service)
POST {{PortfolioService_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jasika Saha",
  "email": "jasika@example.com",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password@123"
}

### Register user (through Ocelot Gateway)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/portfolio/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Jasika Saha",
  "email": "jasika@example.com",
  "mobileNumber": "9876543210",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "confirmPassword": "Password@123"
}
